{"4406530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Holy Doner!", "steam_appid": 4406530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Organize your workspace!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406530/extras/0f7e163a85686e7cb44dac6ab075bb42.poster.avif?t=1773559232\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406530/extras/0f7e163a85686e7cb44dac6ab075bb42.webm?t=1773559232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406530/extras/0f7e163a85686e7cb44dac6ab075bb42.mp4?t=1773559232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Preparation for the working day meditative exercise,  hope your colleagues feel the same way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Experiment with ingredients!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406530/extras/6b53b6f78bf9e9622758156da791e047.poster.avif?t=1773559232\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406530/extras/6b53b6f78bf9e9622758156da791e047.webm?t=1773559232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406530/extras/6b53b6f78bf9e9622758156da791e047.mp4?t=1773559232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's no accounting for taste, right? Everything is in your hands or in the hands of your colleagues.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Delight visitors!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406530/extras/51555097fe56a3e887f7c2a481bcdf32.poster.avif?t=1773559232\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406530/extras/51555097fe56a3e887f7c2a481bcdf32.webm?t=1773559232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406530/extras/51555097fe56a3e887f7c2a481bcdf32.mp4?t=1773559232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The customer is always right! It's not difficult. Lavash, meat, what else...?</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Organize your workspace!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406530/extras/0f7e163a85686e7cb44dac6ab075bb42.poster.avif?t=1773559232\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406530/extras/0f7e163a85686e7cb44dac6ab075bb42.webm?t=1773559232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406530/extras/0f7e163a85686e7cb44dac6ab075bb42.mp4?t=1773559232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Preparation for the working day meditative exercise,  hope your colleagues feel the same way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Experiment with ingredients!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406530/extras/6b53b6f78bf9e9622758156da791e047.poster.avif?t=1773559232\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406530/extras/6b53b6f78bf9e9622758156da791e047.webm?t=1773559232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406530/extras/6b53b6f78bf9e9622758156da791e047.mp4?t=1773559232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's no accounting for taste, right? Everything is in your hands or in the hands of your colleagues.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Delight visitors!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406530/extras/51555097fe56a3e887f7c2a481bcdf32.poster.avif?t=1773559232\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406530/extras/51555097fe56a3e887f7c2a481bcdf32.webm?t=1773559232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406530/extras/51555097fe56a3e887f7c2a481bcdf32.mp4?t=1773559232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The customer is always right! It's not difficult. Lavash, meat, what else...?</p>", "short_description": "Your uncle has gone on a business trip, so now his shawarma stand is yours. Take orders, throw food at customers, and see how they react if you mess up! Compete against the clock alone or create absolute chaos in co-op mode. Can you run a business when everything around you is on fire?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406530/a33aad76a057d6db7cb4aa206f2944cd1523e4e9/header.jpg?t=1773559232", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406530/49f5173ffc81a18fc34483355d03dc73f8c4f297/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773559232", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406530/49f5173ffc81a18fc34483355d03dc73f